<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-shell">
    <image class="hero-image" src="{{heroImage}}" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="hero-mask"></view>
    <view class="hero-content">
      <view>
        <text class="eyebrow">江苏产业需求库 · 南京 / 苏州 / 无锡 / 盐城</text>
        <view class="hero-main">
          <text class="hero-title">把技术成果放进江苏产业场景里，找到真正可能成交的需求</text>
          <text class="hero-copy">TechNexus 基于 JSTEC 真实技术需求库进行快速匹配和 AI 智能匹配。前台不展示需求方身份及联系方式，合作意向统一进入后台人工审核与撮合。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn primary" bindtap="goSubmit">AI匹配成果</button>
          <button class="btn ghost" bindtap="goDemands">需求大厅</button>
          <button class="btn ghost" bindtap="goProgress">查询进度</button>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="hero-kpis">
        <view class="hero-kpi">
          <strong>{{stats.demand_count}}</strong>
          <span>已入库技术需求</span>
        </view>
        <view class="hero-kpi">
          <strong>5条</strong>
          <span>单次返回候选需求</span>
        </view>
        <view class="hero-kpi">
          <strong>3日</strong>
          <span>承诺初步反馈</span>
        </view>
        <view class="hero-kpi">
          <strong>5%</strong>
          <span>成交后服务费</span>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="band hall-entry">
    <view class="band-header">
      <text class="section-title">浏览真实技术需求</text>
      <text class="muted">需求大厅公开展示部分已入库需求，不公开需求方身份，也不提供关键词筛选。提交成果后，AI 会从完整需求库中召回并精排更合适的项目。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="actions">
      <button class="btn ghost" bindtap="goDemands">进入需求大厅</button>
      <button class="btn primary" bindtap="goSubmit">让 AI 帮我找</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="insight-stack">
    <view class="media-card">
      <image class="media-cover" src="{{labImage}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="media-mask"></view>
      <view class="media-copy">
        <strong>科研成果与产业需求双向筛选</strong>
        <span>适合高校、科研院所、技术服务机构和创新型企业提交成果，先匹配，再进入人工撮合。</span>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="metric-grid">
      <view class="metric-card">
        <strong>100</strong>
        <span>匹配评分总分</span>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-card">
        <strong>{{stats.ai_mode}}</strong>
        <span>当前匹配模式</span>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-card">
        <strong>隐藏</strong>
        <span>需求方身份信息</span>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-card">
        <strong>查询码</strong>
        <span>全程追踪对接进度</span>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="media-card">
      <image class="media-cover" src="{{factoryImage}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="media-mask"></view>
      <view class="media-copy">
        <strong>围绕江苏产业场景做真实撮合</strong>
        <span>不是只给分数，而是把可对接项目送入后台审核、联系和跟进流程。</span>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="band">
    <view class="band-header">
      <text class="section-title">技术成果找需求</text>
      <text class="muted">首页先让来访者理解平台怎么工作，再进入完整表单提交成果。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="band-body">
      <view class="quick-preview">
        <view class="sample-field">
          <text class="field-label">成果名称</text>
          <text class="sample-value">高导热石墨烯复合散热材料</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sample-field">
          <text class="field-label">技术领域</text>
          <text class="sample-value">新材料</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sample-field">
          <text class="field-label">技术成果简介</text>
          <text class="sample-value">用于电子器件热管理的高导热复合材料，具备较好的界面结合、加工稳定性和规模化制备潜力。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="mode-row">
        <view class="mode-card active">
          <text class="mode-title">AI 智能匹配</text>
          <text class="muted">调用 DeepSeek API 精排并生成更细的匹配理由。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="mode-card">
          <text class="mode-title">快速匹配</text>
          <text class="muted">不调用 API，仅靠本地规则先看大致方向。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="soft-tip">点击开始匹配后，平台后台会保存本次输入内容，作为潜在线索供人工审核和后续撮合使用。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="band">
    <view class="band-header">
      <text class="section-title">你将看到什么</text>
      <text class="muted">返回 5 条候选需求，展示匹配分、理由和下一步建议。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="preview-list">
      <view wx:for="{{previewResults}}" wx:key="name" class="preview-item">
        <view class="preview-main">
          <strong>{{item.name}}</strong>
          <view class="tags">
            <text wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="tag" class="tag">{{tag}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="preview-score {{item.level}}">{{item.score}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="band">
    <view class="band-header">
      <text class="section-title">平台工作方式</text>
      <text class="muted">不是只给结果，而是帮你持续推进到对接。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="process-list">
      <view wx:for="{{processSteps}}" wx:key="index" class="process-step">
        <view class="step-index">{{item.index}}</view>
        <view class="step-copy">
          <strong>{{item.title}}</strong>
          <span>{{item.copy}}</span>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card dark">
    <text class="section-title">收费规则明示</text>
    <text class="fee-number">5%</text>
    <view class="muted">AI 匹配结果可免费查看。若通过平台撮合并最终成交，按实际成交金额收取技术撮合中介服务费。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card official-card" bindtap="previewQr">
    <image class="official-avatar" src="{{avatar}}" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="official-text">
      <text class="official-strong">关注 OPC 创业汇</text>
      <text class="muted">获取技术撮合进展、项目更新和后续小程序入口。点击可放大二维码。</text>
    </view>
    <image class="official-qr" src="{{qrcode}}" mode="aspectFit" />
  </view>
</view>
